          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wadiishilaŋa nyikoku yamuku windi Yetero, kapristu kakuMidiyani. Watweli nyikoku kunyima yesaŋa, washi kili kumpidi yaNzambi kwokuHorebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova wadi mwekesheli kudi yena mumuzuzu wakesi wafumini mukachi kachiputa. Yena wamweni chiputa chinakwati kesi ilaŋa chiputa kusukuma nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi nindi, Tali niba aluki munjila, nitali chumichi chasweja chinamwekani, muloŋanyi chiputachinabuli kusukuma bwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamumweni hakuba aluka munjila atali, Nzambi omu mwadiŋi yi mukachi kachiputa, hakumutambika nindi, Mosi, Mosi. Yena nindi, Yamonu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Bayi wukundama kwakwihuku. Subulaku nkwabilu jeyi kunyendu yeyi, muloŋa hiwunemani hiiseki dajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahosheli nawa nindi, Yami Nzambi yatata yeyi, Nzambi yaAbarahama, Nzambi yaIsaka, Nzambi yaYakoba. Mosi wadibutili kumesu indi muloŋawatiyili woma wakumutala Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli nindi, Chalala namoni antu ami adi muEjipitu chakumonawu ihuŋu, natiyi chakudilawu nawakwakuyi kalakesha; ami neluki chakabaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasuluki dehi munu niyipulwishi kudi aEjipitu, nakayifumishi mwituŋa odu, nakayitwali mwituŋa dadiwahi deneni dasweja nimayeli niwuchi, mwekalawu ni aKenani, niaHiti, niaAmori, ni aPerizi, niaHivi, niaYebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya dinu, kudila kwadilaŋawu anyana kaIsarela kunashi ki kudami, niikabi dayi kabishaŋawu aEjipitu nadimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichidinu, inzaŋa ni kutemeshi kudi Fwaro, kulonda wuyifumishi antu ami anyana kaIsarela muEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi hakumwila Nzambi, nindi, Amiyaminyi mwaka niyi kudi Fwaro nakufumisha anyana kaIsarela muEjipitu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena nindi, Chalala ami nukwi kala neyi; tiya chuma chiwakeluka nachuneyi yami nakutemeshi; chiwakafumisha antu muEjipitu mwakamukalakela Nzambi hampidi yinu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi hakumwila Nzambi, nindi, Tiya, chinakaya kudi anyana kaIsarela, chinakayila nami, Nzambi yawankakulula jenu nantemeshi ninzi kudenu, niwena akaŋila nawu, ijina dindi hinyi? Indi ami nakayila namidi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wamwilili Mosi, nindi, Ami Yami Mwomunekalila Kwami. Wamwilili nindi, Wakayili anyana kaIsarela, neyi, Yami diyi nantemeshi kudenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi hakumwila Mosi cheŋi, nindi, Tiya chiwakayila anyana kaIsarela, neyi, Yehova Nzambi yawankakulula jenu, Nzambi yaAbarahama, Nzambi yaIsaka, Nzambi yaYakoba, diyi nantemeshi kudenu; ijina dami dodenidi dahaya nyaka, dodamba kaŋanukaŋawu nachu, kunyaka yejima amba kavwali kilaŋawu antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaŋa wakapompeshi awakulumpi awaIsarela, wakayili neyi, Yehova, Nzambi yawankakulula jenu, Nzambi yaAbarahama, niyaIsaka, niyaYakoba, namwekani kudami, nelinindi, Ami chalala nenzi nakuyihempula, namoni chanayi koŋuwu muEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neli nami, Nakayifumisha mumakabi muEjipitu, nakayitwala mwituŋa dawaKenani, nidawaHiti, nidawaAmori, nidawaPerizi, nidawaHivi, nidawaYebusi, mwituŋa dasweja mayeli nawuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena akatiya izu deyi. Nineyi niakulumpi awaIsarela mwakayi kudi mwanta wakuEjipitu, mwakamwilinenu, Yehova, Nzambi yawaHeberu, tunadimoni nindi; atuleki dinumwani, tuyi njila yamafuku asatu mwisaŋa, tumuketwili Yehova Nzambi yetu yimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami neluki nami mwanta waEjipitu hakuyiteja kuyaku, chiŋa naŋovu yayeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nakolola chikasa chami, naketa ituŋa daEjipitu nayuma yami yejima yakuhayamisha yinakakoŋa mukachikawu; nkumininaku wakayileka mwakaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayitiyisha aEjipitu luwi munyichima yawu, akayitiyila antu awa luwi, kulonda chimwakaya mwakabuli kuya makasakasa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ambanda ejima akayilombi akwawu atuŋawu nawu, ni akwawu ashakama mumatalawu, akayilombi yuma yalemayasiliva, niyuma yalema yawuru, niyuma yakuvwala, mwakayivwi ki anyanenu awambanda ni anyanenu amayala; mwakayibuwi aEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
